</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<div class="topline"><span>Thoughtful dentistry, right here in Bengaluru.</span><span>VASANTH NAGAR <i></i> SAHAKAR NAGAR</span></div>
<header class="header wrap">
 <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Amaya Dental Clinic home"><span class="brand-mark">A<span>D</span></span><span class="brand-word">AMAYA<small>DENTAL CLINIC</small></span></a>
 <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#care">Treatments</a><a href="#people">Our story</a><a href="#reviews">Patient stories</a><a href="#visit">Find us</a></nav>
 <a class="header-cta" href="https://amayadental.in/appointments/">Book a consultation <span>↗</span></a>
</header>
<main id="main">
 <section class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star">✳</span> YOUR NEIGHBOURHOOD DENTAL CLINIC</div>
   <h1>Good care.<br/>Real people.<br/><em>More smiles.</em></h1>
   <p class="hero-description">A thoughtful approach to dentistry, and a team that takes the time to listen. Because every smile deserves care.</p>
   <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button dark" href="https://amayadental.in/appointments/">Book a consultation <span>↗</span></a><a class="button outline" href={whatsapp}>WhatsApp us <span>↗</span></a></div>
   <a class="rating" href={maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span><span><strong>5.0 on Google</strong><small>279 reviews · Vasanth Nagar</small></span><span class="rating-arrow">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual"><div class="photo-frame"><img src="/images/clinic.jpg" width="382" height="510" alt="A treatment room at Amaya Dental Clinic" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="photo-label"><span>01 / A LITTLE LOOK INSIDE</span><strong>A calmer kind<br/>of dental visit.</strong><span class="label-arrow">↗</span></div></div><div class="vertical-note">MADE FOR REAL SMILES &nbsp; · &nbsp; BENGALURU</div><div class="hero-stamp"><span>CARE FOR</span><b>every<br/><i>smile</i></b><span>✳ &nbsp; BENGALURU</span></div></div>
 </section>
 <div class="ticker"><div class="wrap ticker-inner"><span>SMILE PE SABKA HAQ HAI.</span><span class="curve">⌣</span><span>EVERY SMILE HAS A STORY.</span><span class="curve">⌣</span><span>LET’S TAKE CARE OF YOURS.</span></div></div>
 <section id="care" class="section wrap care"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star">✳</span> CARE THAT FITS YOU</div><h2>Whatever brings you in,<br/><em>we’re here for you.</em></h2></div><p>From a routine check-up to a bigger change, we’ll help you understand your options and find a plan that feels right.</p></div><div class="treatment-grid">{treatments.map(([n,title,desc,url]) => <a class="treatment" href={url}><span class="treatment-top"><span>{n} / THE CARE</span><span class="circle-arrow">↗</span></span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{desc}</p></a>)}</div><div class="section-foot"><p>Not sure what you need? That’s a perfectly good place to start.</p><a class="text-link" href={whatsapp}>Talk to our team <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
 <section id="people" class="people"><div class="wrap people-grid"><div class="people-image"><img src="/images/doctor.jpg" alt="Dr. Khushboo Mishra pictured alongside the Amaya Dental Clinic logo" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy"/><span class="image-caption">THE PEOPLE BEHIND AMAYA &nbsp; / &nbsp; 01</span></div><div class="people-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star">✳</span> A NOTE FROM AMAYA</div><h2>Good dentistry<br/>starts with <em>listening.</em></h2><p>We know a dental chair isn’t everyone’s favourite place. That’s why we believe in taking the time to understand what’s on your mind, explain what we see, and make decisions together.</p><p>Led by Dr. Khushboo Mishra, our team brings different specialties together with one shared intention: to make you feel looked after.</p><div class="signature">Smile pe sabka haq hai. <span>⌣</span></div><div class="doctor-name"><strong>Dr. Khushboo Mishra</strong><span>Founder · Prosthodontist & TMJ specialist</span></div><a class="text-link" href="https://amayadental.in/our-specialist/">Meet our doctors <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
 <section class="clinic-glimpse wrap"><div class="clinic-glimpse-image"><img src="/images/amaya-gallery.webp" width="1000" height="1333" alt="Entrance to Amaya Dental Clinic with clinic signage" loading="lazy"/></div><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star">✳</span> A LITTLE LOOK INSIDE</div><h2>A familiar place,<br/><em>for every visit.</em></h2><p>A look inside Amaya. From your first hello to your follow-up, our team is here to help you feel at ease.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://amayadental.in/gallery/">See the clinic gallery ↗</a></div></section>
 <section class="section wrap first-visit"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star">✳</span> YOUR FIRST VISIT</div><h2>Come as you are.<br/><em>We’ll take it from there.</em></h2></div><p>First time at Amaya? Here’s a little idea of what to expect. Questions are always welcome.</p></div><div class="steps"><div><span>01</span><h3>Say hello</h3><p>Call, message or book online. Choose the branch that works for you.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Tell us your story</h3><p>Share what brought you in, your concerns and anything you’d like us to know.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Let’s take a look</h3><p>Your dentist will examine your teeth and discuss any scans if needed.</p></div><div><span>04</span><h3>Make a plan together</h3><p>We’ll talk through the options, costs and next steps before you decide.</p></div></div></section>
 <section id="reviews" class="reviews"><div class="wrap review-layout"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star">✳</span> WORDS FROM OUR PATIENTS</div><h2>It means a lot<br/>to <em>be heard.</em></h2><p>Good care is personal. Here’s what a few people have shared about their time with us.</p><a class="text-link" href={maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read reviews on Google <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="quote-list"><div class="quote"><div class="quote-top"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span><span>GOOGLE REVIEW</span></div><blockquote>“They cleared all my doubts and helped me pick the right treatment plan. I appreciate their promt follow-ups which helped me be on track with my treatment.”</blockquote><div class="quote-author"><span class="avatar">AG</span><span><strong>A G</strong><small>Invisalign patient · via Google</small></span></div><span class="quote-mark">”</span></div><div class="quote small-quote"><div class="quote-top"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span><span>GOOGLE REVIEW</span></div><blockquote>“both of them made sure I clearly understood each and every step of the treatment”</blockquote><div class="quote-author"><span class="avatar">JC</span><span><strong>jennifer christine</strong><small>via Google · excerpt</small></span></div></div><div class="quote small-quote"><div class="quote-top"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span><span>GOOGLE REVIEW</span></div><blockquote>“The clinic is spotless and well equipped”</blockquote><div class="quote-author"><span class="avatar">KS</span><span><strong>K Sathish</strong><small>via Google · excerpt</small></span></div></div></div></div></section>
 <section id="visit" class="section wrap visit"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star">✳</span> FIND YOUR AMAYA</div><h2>Two neighbourhoods.<br/><em>One warm welcome.</em></h2></div><p>Find the clinic that’s closer to you. Give us a call before you visit and we’ll help you plan.</p></div><div class="locations"><article><span class="location-no">01 / CENTRAL BENGALURU</span><h3>Vasanth Nagar</h3><p>1st Floor, 8/1, Palace Cross Road,<br/>Vasanth Nagar, Bengaluru 560001</p><p class="hours"><strong>Every day</strong> &nbsp; 9:30 am – 7:30 pm<br/><small>Hours may vary on holidays. Please call to confirm.</small></p><div class="location-links"><a href={maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get directions ↗</a><a href="tel:+919591895500">Call clinic ↗</a></div><small class="address-note">Address shown as listed on Google Maps; confirmation pending.</small></article><article><span class="location-no">02 / NORTH BENGALURU</span><h3>Sahakar Nagar</h3><p>Bhargavi Platinum, #38/4, 1st Floor,<br/>3rd Cross, 20th Main, G Block,<br/>Sahakar Nagar, Bengaluru 560092</p><p class="hours"><strong>Opening hours</strong><br/><small>Please call the clinic to confirm.</small></p><div class="location-links"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bhargavi+Platinum+38%2F4+Sahakar+Nagar+Bengaluru" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find on Maps ↗</a><a href="tel:+916366614266">Call clinic ↗</a></div></article></div></section>
 <section class="faq-section"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star">✳</span> GOOD TO KNOW</div><h2>A few things<br/><em>you might wonder.</em></h2><p>Have another question? We’re just a message away.</p><a class="text-link" href={whatsapp}>Ask us on WhatsApp ↗</a></div><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Will my treatment hurt?<span>+</span></summary><p>Comfort matters to us. Your dentist can explain what to expect and discuss appropriate ways to manage discomfort. Experiences vary by treatment and person.</p></details><details><summary>How much will treatment cost?<span>+</span></summary><p>Costs depend on your needs and the treatment recommended. After an assessment, ask your dentist to explain the options and estimated costs before you decide.</p></details><details><summary>Can I bring my child for a visit?<span>+</span></summary><p>Yes. Amaya offers pediatric dentistry. Let us know your child’s age and any concerns when you book.</p></details><details><summary>I’m visiting from outside India. Can I plan ahead?<span>+</span></summary><p>Yes. Contact the team to discuss your needs and visit dates. See our <a href="https://amayadental.in/dental-tourism-bangalore-india-guide/">dental tourism guide</a> for more information.</p></details></div></div></section>
 <section class="journal section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-star">✳</span> A LITTLE READING</div><h2>Good to know,<br/><em>before you go.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="https://amayadental.in/blog/">Visit the journal ↗</a></div><div class="articles"><a href="https://amayadental.in/dental-tourism-bangalore-india-guide/"><span>FOR INTERNATIONAL PATIENTS &nbsp; / &nbsp; OCT 12, 2026</span><h3>Coming to Bengaluru for dental care?</h3><p>A guide to planning your visit from abroad.</p><b>Read the guide ↗</b></a><a href="https://amayadental.in/bleeding-gums-gingivitis-periodontitis/"><span>ORAL HEALTH &nbsp; / &nbsp; OCT 6, 2026</span><h3>What bleeding gums may be telling you</h3><p>Understanding gingivitis and periodontitis.</p><b>Read the article ↗</b></a><a href="https://amayadental.in/tmj-disorder-symptoms-causes-treatment/"><span>JAW HEALTH &nbsp; / &nbsp; OCT 1, 2026</span><h3>Why does my jaw click or ache?</h3><p>A closer look at TMJ disorders.</p><b>Read the article ↗</b></a></div></section>
 <section class="closing"><div class="wrap closing-inner"><div><div class="eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO START</div><h2>Let’s take care<br/>of that <em>smile.</em></h2><p>We’re ready when you are.</p></div><div><a class="button light" href="https://amayadental.in/appointments/">Book a consultation <span>↗</span></a><a class="closing-call" href="tel:+919591895500">Or call +91 95918 95500 ↗</a></div><span class="closing-curve">⌣</span></div></section>
